{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53025","headline":"诗 · 姜窈窕","name":"诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数行心因鲤鱼传，轻放金鈎绣帐悬。\n不是娇慵贪昼卧，衆中无处看花牋。\n（同前卷下引《本传》）（按：《琅嬛记》云「张叔良字房卿，大历中与姜窈窕相悦」。\n录二人诗三首。\n今检《唐诗纪事》卷三一载，张叔良爲广德二年登进士第，与此云大历相合。\n姜窈窕诗二首，其中《春思》「门前梅柳烂春辉」一首，《全唐诗》卷八○二作张窈窕诗。\n张、姜故事，或出後人附会，而诗作则似别有依据，故仍录存之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姜窈窕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53025.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53025","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}